{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02423","headline":"寄赠齐公 · 杜淹","name":"寄赠齐公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冠盖游梁日，诗书问志年。\n佩兰长坂上，攀桂小山前。\n结交澹若水，履道直如弦。\n此欢终未极，于兹独播迁。\n赭衣登蜀道，白首别秦川。\n泪随沟水逝，心逐晓旌悬。\n去去逾千里，悠悠隔九天。\n郊野间长薄，城阙隐凝烟。\n关门共月对，山路与云连。\n此时寸心里，难用尺书传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜淹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}